  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY:\nTransitive ({他動詞|たどうし})\nIntransitive pair: {溶|と}ける\n\nUSAGE:\n- {熱|ねつ}で{溶|と}かす (to melt with heat)\n- {水|みず}に{溶|と}かす (to dissolve in water)\n- {溶|と}かして{混|ま}ぜる (to melt and mix)\n\nCOOKING:\n- バター/チョコレートを{溶|と}かす (to melt butter/chocolate)\n- {粉|こな}を{水|みず}で{溶|と}かす (to dissolve powder in water)\n\nKANJI NOTE:\n{溶|と}かす - for dissolving/melting (most common in cooking)\n{融|と}かす - for melting metals or ice\n{解|と}かす - for melting/thawing frozen items\n\nRELATED:\n- {溶|と}ける (to melt, to dissolve - intransitive)\n- {溶解|ようかい} (dissolution)\n- {融解|ゆうかい} (melting)",
